      "description": "<p>Aircraft crashes into field after departing from nearby city of Pisco, according to local authorities</p><p>Police in Peru report that 13 people, among them foreign tourists, have been killed in a plane crash in southern Peru, near the Nazca Lines.</p><p>Local authorities in Nazca confirmed that 11 tourists and two pilots died when the Cessna Grand Caravan crashed in Pueblo Viejo, approximately 4 miles (6km) from the city of Nazca and roughly 12km from the Nazca Lines site.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/01/at-least-13-dead-as-tourist-plane-crashes-during-flight-over-perus-nazca-lines\">Continue reading...</a>",
